// Ch15 B03 "The fin" (C, 1 min). U05: a hiss first; the sea-glow brightens in a line off the starboard bow,
// and the line moves. U06: the Wakefin's blade rises and circles; Kerrid has his anchor-cleaver off his
// back. The first wake in four hundred years drew it out of the lagoon. Then the flow starts the fight.
title: ch15_the_fin
location: ch15/open_sea
---
@letterbox on
@music silence fade=0.5
@sfx fin_cut
@camera U05
@wait 2.5
@camera U06
@anim kerrid draw_cleaver
Pell [afraid]: It followed the ripples. #line:ch15_fin_001
@wait 1.0
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch15_wakefin>>
===
